{"id":"394f2aea09fc7e21","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-formula-substitution.md","title":"Substitution as Homomorphism","display":"df-formula-substitution — Substitution as Homomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-formula-substitution","aliases":["57-df-formula-substitution"],"display":"df-formula-substitution — Substitution as Homomorphism","depends_on":["[[57-df-formula-algebra]]","[[57-df-term]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-formula-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-formula-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formula-substitution — Substitution as Homomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4829220d0330e683\" href=\"?note=4829220d0330e683\" title=\"57-df-formula-algebra\">57-df-formula-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormulaAlgebra}(\\mathfrak F_S,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{FormulaAlgebra}(\\mathfrak F_S,S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,(f_i^{\\mathfrak F})_{i\\in I}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,(f_i^{\\mathfrak F})_{i\\in I}\\rangle\\)</span>，以及该定义的支持映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span>、元数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_i\">\\(n_i\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4829220d0330e683\" href=\"?note=4829220d0330e683\" title=\"57-df-formula-algebra\">57-df-formula-algebra</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathfrak F}\">\\(S_{\\mathfrak F}\\)</span> 是候选三元函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S)\">\\(\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S)\\)</span> 在下式定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{x,t}\">\\(S_{x,t}\\)</span> 是其候选切片图。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in F^F:\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall(p_1,\\ldots,p_{n_i})\\in F^{n_i}\\;\nh(f_i^{\\mathfrak F}(p_1,\\ldots,p_{n_i}))=\nf_i^{\\mathfrak F}(h(p_1),\\ldots,h(p_{n_i}))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in F^F:\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall(p_1,\\ldots,p_{n_i})\\in F^{n_i}\\;\nh(f_i^{\\mathfrak F}(p_1,\\ldots,p_{n_i}))=\nf_i^{\\mathfrak F}(h(p_1),\\ldots,h(p_{n_i}))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_{x,t}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in F^2:S_{\\mathfrak F}(p,x,t)=q\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_{x,t}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in F^2:S_{\\mathfrak F}(p,x,t)=q\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Subst}(S_{\\mathfrak F},\\mathfrak F_S)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;S_{\\mathfrak F}:F\\times\\mathrm{Var}\\times\\mathrm{Term}_S\\to F\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;(S_{x,t}\\in\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall p\\in F\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\n(x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(p)\\to S_{\\mathfrak F}(p,x,t)=p).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Subst}(S_{\\mathfrak F},\\mathfrak F_S)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;S_{\\mathfrak F}:F\\times\\mathrm{Var}\\times\\mathrm{Term}_S\\to F\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;(S_{x,t}\\in\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall p\\in F\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\n(x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(p)\\to S_{\\mathfrak F}(p,x,t)=p).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留抽象代数中的代换同态条件；补第三个子句遗漏的 t 量词，并使切片及自同态有真实定义。不无条件断言它与允许捕获、会屏蔽束缚变量的具体语法代入相同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-formula-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"4829220d0330e683","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"053d3ef4d2401abe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"4829220d0330e683","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\mathrm{FormulaAlgebra}(\\mathfrak F_S,S)$，$\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,(f_i^{\\mathfrak F})_{i\\in I}\\rangle$，以及该定义的支持映射 $\\mathrm{FV}$、元数 $n_i$，见 [[57-df-formula-algebra]]。$\\mathrm{Term}_S$、$\\mathrm{Var}$ 见 [[57-df-term]]、[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。$S_{\\mathfrak F}$ 是候选三元函数；$\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S)$ 在下式定义，$S_{x,t}$ 是其候选切片图。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"053d3ef4d2401abe","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\mathrm{FormulaAlgebra}(\\mathfrak F_S,S)$，$\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,(f_i^{\\mathfrak F})_{i\\in I}\\rangle$，以及该定义的支持映射 $\\mathrm{FV}$、元数 $n_i$，见 [[57-df-formula-algebra]]。$\\mathrm{Term}_S$、$\\mathrm{Var}$ 见 [[57-df-term]]、[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。$S_{\\mathfrak F}$ 是候选三元函数；$\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S)$ 在下式定义，$S_{x,t}$ 是其候选切片图。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\mathrm{FormulaAlgebra}(\\mathfrak F_S,S)$，$\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,(f_i^{\\mathfrak F})_{i\\in I}\\rangle$，以及该定义的支持映射 $\\mathrm{FV}$、元数 $n_i$，见 [[57-df-formula-algebra]]。$\\mathrm{Term}_S$、$\\mathrm{Var}$ 见 [[57-df-term]]、[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。$S_{\\mathfrak F}$ 是候选三元函数；$\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S)$ 在下式定义，$S_{x,t}$ 是其候选切片图。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FormulaAlgebra}(\\mathfrak F_S,S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,(f_i^{\\mathfrak F})_{i\\in I}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}","display":false},{"tex":"n_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"S_{\\mathfrak F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S)","display":false},{"tex":"S_{x,t}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in F^F:\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall(p_1,\\ldots,p_{n_i})\\in F^{n_i}\\;\nh(f_i^{\\mathfrak F}(p_1,\\ldots,p_{n_i}))=\nf_i^{\\mathfrak F}(h(p_1),\\ldots,h(p_{n_i}))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"S_{x,t}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in F^2:S_{\\mathfrak F}(p,x,t)=q\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Subst}(S_{\\mathfrak F},\\mathfrak F_S)\\leftrightarrow{}&S_{\\mathfrak F}:F\\times\\mathrm{Var}\\times\\mathrm{Term}_S\\to F\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;(S_{x,t}\\in\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S))\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall p\\in F\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\n(x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(p)\\to S_{\\mathfrak F}(p,x,t)=p).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1718,"backlinks":[{"id":"16221232b47bde4c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"368eba82736e6dc0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d4a3e97d0f2dc4db","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[57-df-formula-substitution]] 的 $F,\\mathfrak F_S,S_{\\mathfrak F},\\mathrm{FV},I,n_i$。$p\\in F$、$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$、$t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S$。为兼容原代数性质定理，$p[x/t]$ 表示在变量 $x$ 处代入项 $t$；这里明确保留该文件的参数排印次序，它不同于语法文件的 $\\varphi[t/x]$。元组代换逐分量定义。"},{"id":"7f378a9e1168485b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"假定 $\\mathrm{FormulaAlgebra}(\\mathfrak F_S,S)$ 和 $\\mathrm{Subst}(S_{\\mathfrak F},\\mathfrak F_S)$，见 [[57-df-formula-algebra]]、[[57-df-formula-substitution]]；载体、运算、元数及 $\\mathrm{FV}$ 采用这些文件的固定环境。$p[x/t]$ 与元组代换见 [[57-ax-substitution-schema]]。"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\